{"id": "69191", "title": "照日天劫", "author": "默默猴", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 14, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69191.htm", "intro": "英雄最可悲的不是被误会，而是明知自己是英雄却浑身使不上劲的痛苦，我们的主角正面临这样的危机，他是这个世界最后的希望，他是拯救万民的最后一道防线，然而此刻的他却毫无作用，日日买醉，唯一陪伴他的就是身边的妹妹，肉欲可以麻痹自己，但是酒醒时的空虚却无人能够驱散…\r\n关键字：照日天劫,1-12卷,删节,精校版,楔子,欲望,尽头,还有", "base": "files/article/html/69/69191", "chapters": [{"title": "1-2", "file": "10586901.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "10586902.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "10586903.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5-6", "file": "10586904.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-7", "file": "10586905.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "10586906.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "10586907.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "10586908.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11上", "file": "10586909.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11中", "file": "10586910.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11下", "file": "10586911.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12上", "file": "10586912.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11下", "file": "10586913.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12完结", "file": "10586914.html", "available": false}]}